  m_text: '

    Under Tipu Sultan''s patronage, his armies started manufacturing
    rockets extensively known as Mysorean Rockets or Tipu Rockets which were an upgraded
    version of Chinese design. Men in Tipu''s army created rockets that were made
    of metal tubes filled with gunpowder and were equipped with stabilizing rods
    at the rear.'
