      m_Calls: []
  m_text: These paintings are drawn on the walls of the prakaram. It was told that
    the granite walls are plastered with lime mortar and  painted before the surface
    gets dried. These painting are very much similar to Thanjavur Periya kovil praharam
    walls. The materials may be of natural dye. The story of the Nayanmars are painted
    on the north side of the praharam wall. Also some of the paintings are done on
    the sanctum walls.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
