  m_text: '

    Lord Shiva as Kalasamharamurthy also known as Kalantaka, seen here
    dancing in fury on Yamadharmaraja. This aspect of Lord Shiva depicts him as the
    ultimate one, the conqueror of time & death. He manifests in this form to save
    his great bhaktha, Markandeya from Lord Yama'
