  m_text: '

    Serfoji was born on 24 September 1777 in the royal house of the
    Maratha king, Chattrapati Shivaji. Raja Thulajah, the king of Thanjavur acknowledged
    him as his son on 23 January 1787 by duly performing all of the religious rites.
    The boy was entrusted to the care of Rev'
